  "description": "\"Key Features\n\n1. Link System – The Closer, the Stronger\nSP charging speed increases as you keep two ships close\nUnique gameplay where distance control is the strategy\n\n2. Powerful Blast Attack\nA super-powerful attack triggered when ships are linked\nA single blow that turns the battlefield with timing and cooperation\n\n3. 2-Player Local Co-op\nA shooting game that requires true cooperation\nPlay where position, timing, and coordination are all crucial\n\n4. SP Management-Based Strategy\nThe closer you get, the stronger you become, but the higher the risk\nPlay that balances risk and reward\n\n5. Roguelike Upgrade System\nSelect upgrades after clearing a boss\nCombat style that changes with every playthrough\n\n6. Story Mode with Twist upon Twist\nShort but intensely immersive\nUnexpected plot twists and a clean ending\"",
